    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "PROTEIN\nPOWER BOX\nSnack Box\nSeasoned Tuna\nSriracha Hummus\nCluten Free Crackers\nAlmonds\nFruit Mediey\nNET WT 6.88 OZ (195g)",
      "PROTEIN\nPOWER\nBOX\nSnack Box\nSeasoned Tuna\nSriracha Hummus\nCluter Free Crackers\nAlmonds\nFruit Medley\nNET WT 6.88 OZ (195g)",
      "TUNA INGREDIENTS:\nLIGHT TUNE, MARINADE (WATER, SOYA OIL, SUGAR, SALT, LEMON JUICE, CITRIC ACID, MODIFIED FOOD STARCH,\nVEGETABLE BROTH GUAR GUM, LEMON FLAVOR), BLACK PEPPER.\nHUMMUS INGREDIENTS:\nJALAPENO PEPPERS. EXTRA-VIRGIN OLIVE O\nGARBANZO BEANS, WATER, SESAME PASTE, RED\nGARLIC, APPLE CIDER VINEGAR,\nSEA SALT, DEMERARA SUGAR.\nCRACKER INGREDIENTS.\nGREEN ONION, LEMON JUICE CONCENTRATE, CITRIC ACID.\nBROWN RICE FLOUR, CORN FLOUR, GLUTEN FREE OATS, POTATO STARCH, POTATO\nFLAKES, HIGH OLEIC SUNFLOWER OIL (TOCOPHERLS, ROSEMARY EXTRACT AND ASCORBYL PALMITATE ADDED AS AN ANTIOXIDANT), RICE\nFLOUR, SUGAR, MILLET,\nCANE SUGAR,\nAUTOLYZED YEAST, BAKING SODA,\nSEA SALT, WI SY PROTEIN CONCENTRATE, YEAST (SORBITAN MONOSTEARATE, ASCORBIC ACID), SALT,\nPYROPHOSPHATE.\nMONOCALCIUM PHL SPHATE, SUNFLOWER LECITHIN, NATURAL BUTTER FLAVOR\nALMOND INGREDIENTS:\nALMONDS.\nRUIT MEDLEY INGREDIENTS:\nSUNFLOWER OIL.\nRAISINS, DRIED CHERRIES, DRIED APPLES, SUGAR,\nALLERGENS: TUNA CONTAINS TUNA, SOY.\nCRACKERS CONTAIN MILK. ALMONDS CONTAIN ALMONDS.\nDISTRIBUTED BY DAKFIELD FARMS SOLUTIONS, LL, CRAPSUNE, TEXAS 7COE1\nBEST BY 07/14/18",
      "virgin america",
      "DOWER TEN\nSnack Bor\nSeasoned Tuna\nSrirasha Humeser\nSriract\nCluten Free Crackers\nAlmonds\nonds\nNET WTG:88 02(1950)\n(195g)"
